   read $a[0] afresh: w
   read $a[0] afresh: x
   read 1:   TS::FETCH
   read 2:   TS::FETCH
   read 3:   TS::FETCH
   read 4:   TS::FETCH
   read after the kill: undef
   undef the referent:
   weaken:
   write 'w':
  DESTROY
  TA::FETCH[0]
  TA::FETCH[0]
  TA::FETCH[0]
  TA::FETCH[0]
  TA::FETCH[0]
  TA::STORE[0] ref
  TA::STORE[0] undef
  TA::STORE[0] w
  TA::STORE[0] x
  TS::FETCH
  TS::STORE ref
  TS::STORE undef
  TS::STORE w
  TS::TIESCALAR
  TS::TIESCALAR
1. tie the temporary proxy $a[0]:
2. tie a held proxy, then three reads, a write, a read:
3. weaken the held, doubly magical proxy, then kill the referent (both ties keep weak copies):
end
